            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## 0.6.0

First stable release. Everything from the 0.5.x betas:

- Interrupt button, showTerminalProgress hint, prompt templates, Duplicate Task
- Recordable shortcuts for New Task, Back to Board, Inspector, Changes, Stop Pi, Command Palette
- Changes panel: branch sync, Push without commit, Open Pull Request
- Worktree reminder on Done, session summary on cards and in the inspector
- Command palette (View > Command Palette...)
]]></description>
